                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "c7d2bcf3-508d-3e2b-acfa-1c5539680ea5",
                        "entry_id": "db52992e-7a24-381e-a963-ead91c1740a7",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Maître spirituel hindou."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "bbff9903-dc27-461d-a84e-0400fc9c2c8e",
                                "sense_id": "c7d2bcf3-508d-3e2b-acfa-1c5539680ea5",
                                "text": "le véritable gourou tranche les huit liens du disciples par sa compassion sans faille ; ces huit liens, qui font obstacle à la réalisation, sont la haine, le doute, la crainte, la honte, la médisance, le conformisme, l’arrogance et la conscience de caste, de « naissance »."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "234ae2cf-cc39-3a6e-8716-1cda7e975e4e",
                        "entry_id": "db52992e-7a24-381e-a963-ead91c1740a7",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Expert dans un domaine particulier dont les avis sont largement reconnus et respectés."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "broadly"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "9a873013-c404-4e42-979a-41565ff6a8fc",
                                "sense_id": "234ae2cf-cc39-3a6e-8716-1cda7e975e4e",
                                "text": "John Carmack est un gourou de la programmation informatique 3D."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "5e2d9bf5-3e5c-3606-840e-77f3e072c222",
                        "entry_id": "db52992e-7a24-381e-a963-ead91c1740a7",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Chef d’un petit groupe spirituel, manipulateur, sectaire, fantaisiste, ou même dangereux."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "24c56d65-5b6f-43ba-82fa-9e28f5f8d9f2",
                                "sense_id": "5e2d9bf5-3e5c-3606-840e-77f3e072c222",
                                "text": "Enfin le gourou parle : tout est simple, aucune sorcellerie dans cette affaire, il s’agit d’un simple phénomène de psychokinèse provoqué par le psychisme perturbé de M. Boudon dont le déphasomètre a justement mesuré le déphasage psychique. Tout se recoupe parfaitement."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "fa42663c-78a7-46b8-8175-556788bb35c8",
                                "sense_id": "5e2d9bf5-3e5c-3606-840e-77f3e072c222",
                                "text": "Sous influence d'un gourou arabe, Chakib Khalil qui vivait à Genève, Messali issu d'un milieu fétichiste, tomba totalement sous l'influence de ce sbire du nationalisme arabe alors en gestation, jusqu'à devenir une marionnette entre ses mains […]."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "23bea98d-dc07-4f3f-869f-2d7d3e025182",
                                "sense_id": "5e2d9bf5-3e5c-3606-840e-77f3e072c222",
                                "text": "Le gourou de la secte Aum sera pendu."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "443aa3fa-84aa-3504-9121-31dcbd891a8a",
                        "entry_id": "db52992e-7a24-381e-a963-ead91c1740a7",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Personne qui dit aux autres quoi faire en prétendant avoir la vérité, et dont les adeptes sont assimilés à des disciples."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "broadly"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "ff9e44ab-fcbd-4411-81a9-2f422e77a6d1",
                                "sense_id": "443aa3fa-84aa-3504-9121-31dcbd891a8a",
                                "text": "J'aime pas beaucoup les nutritionnistes. C'est des gourous."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c82b0291-fc7d-47ca-8dc8-2a88964e3aa5",
                                "sense_id": "443aa3fa-84aa-3504-9121-31dcbd891a8a",
                                "text": "C'est ainsi, et c'est un comble, que le discours œnologiquement correct qui s'est imposé au pays de Rabelais, de Molière et de Gentil-Bernard est inspiré par la prose gluante de Robert Paker, le gourou du Maryland amateur d'arômes de ketchup et de senteurs de boite à épices."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "0f88d1d3-c321-43bd-a709-4628bb3123a2",
                        "source_entry_id": "db52992e-7a24-381e-a963-ead91c1740a7",
                        "target_lang_word": "Guru",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Guru",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0394c7d1-3a96-3c89-b8de-545d6fff2767",
                                        "entry_id": "34b4f5ca-0f68-3381-85a4-19f9bb855ba7",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "religiöser Lehrer im Hinduismus, Buddhismus und der Sikhreligion, welcher als Verkörperung eines göttlichen Wesens verehrt wird"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "aa30c914-ba82-435a-806a-34db87ae3fc9",
                                                "sense_id": "0394c7d1-3a96-3c89-b8de-545d6fff2767",
                                                "text": "„Zwar durfte der Guru für seine Unterweisungen keine Bezahlung verlangen, doch war es für den Schüler durchaus üblich, zur ökonomischen Basis des Meisterhaushaltes, dem er ja angehörte, durch Arbeiten beizutragen […].“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4438df96-70d1-4f93-b6af-cb325ae3517d",
                                                "sense_id": "0394c7d1-3a96-3c89-b8de-545d6fff2767",
                                                "text": "„Für einen Guru führte er sogar ein außergewöhnlich geordnetes und friedliches Familienleben.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2523660f-7da9-4a3d-81d3-298aefe397a0",
                                                "sense_id": "0394c7d1-3a96-3c89-b8de-545d6fff2767",
                                                "text": "„Dort reiht sie sich in die anscheinend endlose Schlange von Menschen ein, die auf eine Audienz beim großen Guru warten.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4a3181cb-9ecc-4b71-8e97-4387d1b0f83e",
                                                "sense_id": "0394c7d1-3a96-3c89-b8de-545d6fff2767",
                                                "text": "„In seinem Wesen, das allem Pomp abhold war, glich er am ehesten einem indischen Heiligen, einem erwählten Guru.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bc2b7fee-e12e-4b47-8f15-28574591c426",
                                                "sense_id": "0394c7d1-3a96-3c89-b8de-545d6fff2767",
                                                "text": "„Darüber hinaus ging Aurangzeb gegen die im Punjab aufkommende Religionsgemeinschaft der Sikhs vor und ließ Tegh Bahadur, den neunten Guru der Sikhs, hinrichten.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3c34e2dd-78ed-338b-9031-0da7ec84e6a5",
                                        "entry_id": "34b4f5ca-0f68-3381-85a4-19f9bb855ba7",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Person, die auf einem bestimmten (Fach-)Gebiet ein Fachmann oder Vorbild ist und bisweilen die Leitfunktion hat"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "colloquial"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ead74a30-d0ad-48e0-a8a1-904e3ccc2bcb",
                                                "sense_id": "3c34e2dd-78ed-338b-9031-0da7ec84e6a5",
                                                "text": "„Jetzt gibt es ein amüsantes Buch mit Worterfindungen, das dem Sprach-Guru aktuell nacheifern will: ‚Wortschatz: 698 neue Worte für alle Lebenslagen.‘“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8f9c4b24-15e3-44ac-b246-8e2d0a4452cb",
                                                "sense_id": "3c34e2dd-78ed-338b-9031-0da7ec84e6a5",
                                                "text": "„[Es] begann es für den Apple-Guru nicht einmal so schlecht: Jobs´ Krebserkrankung wurde mehr oder minder zufällig entdeckt, aber dennoch in einem frühen Stadium.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"2\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "195711ba-8edc-4183-a59f-4306877981ee",
                        "source_entry_id": "db52992e-7a24-381e-a963-ead91c1740a7",
                        "target_lang_word": "guru",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "guru",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "17168de9-3ef1-3214-adbf-00f22c369140",
                                        "entry_id": "a35da3c0-6253-3384-863f-6d115c250648",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "In Indian traditions: a spiritual teacher who transmits knowledge to a shishya."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "33c7ba9b-d4fa-4c17-9011-d06243cad55b",
                                                "sense_id": "17168de9-3ef1-3214-adbf-00f22c369140",
                                                "text": "When the gooroo arrives at the house of a disciple, the whole family prostrate themselves at his feet, and the spiritual guide puts his right foot on the heads of the prostrate family."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b05b19d2-f962-48da-bfea-fa75dc1c5749",
                                                "sense_id": "17168de9-3ef1-3214-adbf-00f22c369140",
                                                "text": "The Baiga magicians derive from the old guru who succeeded Nanga Baiga. There is very great confusion about the original guru, and how he was actually related to Nanga Baiga, but there is general agreement that there were originally four great Baiga guru—Daugun, Nindhan, Danantar and Madhakawar, all four brothers."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d9148a23-0533-4795-af87-39f6e67feff0",
                                                "sense_id": "17168de9-3ef1-3214-adbf-00f22c369140",
                                                "text": "These guru, third, were responsible for insuring that the populace would not be tempted to support heterodox world renouncers and their counter-patrimonial ideas. In contrast to the pre-classical Brahmin scholars, who serviced only their own and certain ruler and elite religion-social interests, the guru were the patronal guides of the masses, offering prebendal control of the deities through charismatic but morally expounded magic and psychological compensation as personal confessors, in return for popular willingness to conform to the dharmic rules, as interpreted by guru to be sure."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9bf114e4-f83f-4ae3-a44d-41befeab2630",
                                                "sense_id": "17168de9-3ef1-3214-adbf-00f22c369140",
                                                "text": "Many of the deities and beliefs recorded by the guru are in fact unknown to the common people, and some represent the esoteric knowledge of only a few guru."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "39b99708-7da0-4b6c-9e9d-311a3bcf0478",
                                                "sense_id": "17168de9-3ef1-3214-adbf-00f22c369140",
                                                "text": "Traditionally, a guru is a spiritual teacher who guides a student on the road to Enlightenment, or finding God."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "10b9b857-71d6-337c-8d77-8e8f715fe461",
                                        "entry_id": "a35da3c0-6253-3384-863f-6d115c250648",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Any general teacher (as a term of respect)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "India"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5094bb57-79dc-3734-a7fa-3798ff9c251c",
                                        "entry_id": "a35da3c0-6253-3384-863f-6d115c250648",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An influential advisor or mentor."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "humorous",
                                            "sometimes"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c455db28-4713-4210-904c-4a5b10de0b45",
                                                "sense_id": "5094bb57-79dc-3734-a7fa-3798ff9c251c",
                                                "text": "Many oenophiles rely on the ratings and recommendations of wine guru Robert Parker when selecting the perfect bottle."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d21046a5-0a75-376e-8c0a-3a3171129913",
                                        "entry_id": "a35da3c0-6253-3384-863f-6d115c250648",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A fraudster or conman relying on a projected air of confidence in an obscure field."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "derogatory"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "819acf30-f07b-4a12-acfd-ba3384b92012",
                                                "sense_id": "d21046a5-0a75-376e-8c0a-3a3171129913",
                                                "text": "OPCA gurus are modern legal alchemists. They promise gold, but their methods are principally intended to impress the gullible, or those who wish to use this drivel to abuse the court system. Any lack of legal success by the OPCA litigant is, of course, portrayed as a consequence of the customer’s failure to properly understand and apply the guru's special knowledge."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "guru",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "eab46ce0-e498-3431-9633-da9fc06725ba",
                                        "entry_id": "b11b643e-a93c-3728-8481-22f7b59c7419",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To act as a guru; to give wise advice"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
